  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(5x - 3)²\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n(a - b)² = a² - 2ab + b²\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (5x - 3)² = (5x)² - 2 × (5x) × 3 + 3²\n\n⇒ 25x² - 30x + 9\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 25x² - 30x + 9.**",
